{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36407","headline":"秋夕寄友人 · 罗邺","name":"秋夕寄友人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"秋夕苍茫一雁过，西风白露满宫莎。\n昨来京洛逢归客，犹说轩车未渡河。\n莫把少年空倚赖，须知孤立易蹉跎。\n想君怀抱哀吟夜，铜雀台前皓月多。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"罗邺","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36407.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36407","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}